note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Residual model routing and SHA block planning. Sizes are supplied by the C ABI shell.
note Binary64 prediction, fit, tables and admission already live in cm_* units from CUDApp#291.
fn cm_route mode ulong data edit ulong 16 to ulong
if eq mode 0
note SHA256 block cursor; floor division and remainder preserve every size_t input.
nbytes = get data 0
put data 1 div nbytes 64
put data 2 rem nbytes 64
put data 3 mul div nbytes 64 64
ret 1
end
if eq mode 1
note Blob body size is a sum of ABI object sizes, not a reimplementation of their layouts.
total = ulong 0
for i ulong 6
total = add total get data i
end
ret total
end
if eq mode 2
if lt get data 0 get data 1
ret 1
end
ret 0
end
if eq mode 3
ret add get data 0 get data 1
end
if eq mode 4
ret sub get data 0 get data 1
end
ret 0
end
